submission_format:
Return a JSON object with the same keys and nesting as the example below.

```json
{
  "artifacts": {
    "run_log": "/workspace/output/run.jsonl"
  }
}
```

Use the format below for the file `/workspace/output/run.jsonl`:
JSONL, one record per sample. phase is "equilibration" or "production"; directional temperatures are K and energy_eV_per_atom is total potential plus kinetic energy per atom. Overall temperature is derived as (Tx_K + Ty_K + Tz_K) / 3.
```text
{"type":"sample","phase":"production","Tx_K":301.0,"Ty_K":299.0,"Tz_K":300.0,"energy_eV_per_atom":-3.65}
```
